  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Ties amongst Syrian Civil Society</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intended objective of the proposed project is:&#xA0;&#xA0;
&#xA0;
Syrian civil society actors across geographical areas and sectors come together to learn, exchange and coordinate themselves to engage with wider stakeholders and advocate for the rights of Syrians.&#xA0;&#xA0;
&#xA0;
This is done by enhancing the linkages through two networks, SCNP in amplifying the voice of Syrian civil society.</narrative>
  </description>
